profiles.body:
Nadia is a CF-certified coach and psychologist, trained in Systemic Constellations therapy and Psychosomatics. Her specialty is exploring how the subconscious blocks and hidden inner dynamics impact both mental and physical well-being; burnout prevention and increasing the energy levels.

Nadia supports clients experiencing

- stress-related physical complaints;
- reduced vitality and difficulties restoring energy;
- nervous-system exhaustion;
- anxiety and emotional overload;
- recurring relational or family patterns explored through constellations
- periods of life transition marked by inner instability or loss of direction.

As a trained Constellations practitioner, Nadia regularly conducts workshops that offer a window into the subconscious by working with deep emotional energetic connections and aligning with their authentic path forward.
